<title>SOUTH AFRICA: King Food in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>King Food in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Food Holdings Ltd advised shareholders on Friday that negotiations were in progress which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on the share price of King Food.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in King Food shares.</p>
<p>King Food said a further announcement would be made in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
